      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This article examines one institution's transition into rapid progression after cardiac surgery. This includes clinical guidelines and the integral use of outcomes measures to govern care. Fast-track initiatives are examined in the scope of cost containment. A comprehensive, multidisciplinary approach is emphasized throughout."},
